// Code Organization
- Prefer modular code structure for maintainability and scalability.

// Separation of Concerns
- Keep UI components focused on rendering and user interactions.
- Isolate business logic from UI components; handle core functionality separately.

// React Best Practices
- Use functional components and React hooks for state and side effects management.

// Styling
- Avoid inline or built-in styles; use external style.css for all UI styling.